    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Aqdus Haq, an ophthalmology resident from Shifa International Hospital, Islamabad participated in our week-long simulation-based cataract surgery course on the Eyesi simulator. The course focused on using phacoemulsification for cataract removal. Faculty from the section of ophthalmology provided mentorship.",
